[{"id":"NDI-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{\\left ( 2^{4} \\right )^{8}}{\\left ( 4^{8} \\right )^{2}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;2^{4}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)^{8}}{\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;4^{8}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)^{2}}\" />&nbsp;sama dengan</p>","choices":["1/4","1/2","1","2","8"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTcxMQ"},{"id":"NDI-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d4d31c9f-f094-f054-a88d-84f082b3b178\">Bando selalu berkata bohong. Suatu hari dia berkata kepada tetangganya, Andi : &ldquo;Paling tidak salah satu diantara kita tidak pernah berbohong.&rdquo; Dari informasi ini kita merasa pasti bahwa</span></p>","choices":["Andi selalu berbohong","Andi sesekali berbohong","Andi selalu berkata benar","Andi sesekali berkata benar","Andi tidak pernah berkata apa pun"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTczMQ"},{"id":"NDI-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan n terbesar sehingga <img title=\"8^{n}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?8^{n}\" /> membagi <img title=\"44^{44}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?44^{44}\" />&nbsp;adalah</p>","choices":["8","22","29","44","88</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTczMw"},{"id":"NDI-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pernyataan manaknh yang benar ?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;Jika x &lt; 0 maka <img title=\"\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" /> &gt; x","&nbsp;Jika&nbsp;<img title=\"\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" />&nbsp;&gt; 0 maka x &gt; 0","Jika&nbsp;<img title=\"\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" />&nbsp;&gt; x maka x &gt; 0","Jika&nbsp;<img title=\"\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" />&nbsp;&gt; x maka x &lt; 0","&nbsp;Jika x &lt; 1 maka&nbsp;<img title=\"\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\tetrm{X^{2}}\" />&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc0MQ"},{"id":"NDI-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan&nbsp; <img title=\"X^{^{-n}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?X^{^{-n}}\" /> &nbsp;sama&nbsp; dengan&nbsp;<img title=\"\\left ( \\frac{1}6{} \\right )^{^{n}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{1}6{}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)^{^{n}}\" />&nbsp;untuk setiap bilangan real x. Maka <img title=\"A^{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A^{3}\" /> &minus; <img title=\"A^{-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A^{-3}\" />&nbsp;sama&nbsp; &nbsp;dengan</p>","choices":["<img title=\"\\left ( a-\\frac{1}{a} \\right )\\left ( a^{2} + 1 \\frac{1}{a^{2}} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;a-\\frac{1}{a}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;a^{2}&amp;space;+&amp;space;1&amp;space;\\frac{1}{a^{2}}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" />","<img title=\"\\left ( \\frac{1}{a} - a \\right )\\left ( a^{2} - 1 \\frac{1}{a^{2}} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{1}{a}&amp;space;-&amp;space;a&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;a^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;1&amp;space;\\frac{1}{a^{2}}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" />","&nbsp; <img title=\"\\left ( a-\\frac{1}{a} \\right )\\left ( a^{2} -2 + \\frac{1}{a^{2}} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;a-\\frac{1}{a}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;a^{2}&amp;space;-2&amp;space;+&amp;space;\\frac{1}{a^{2}}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" />","<img title=\"\\left ( \\frac{1}{a} - a \\right )\\left (\\frac{1}{a^{2}} + 1 + a^{2} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{1}{a}&amp;space;-&amp;space;a&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\\left&amp;space;(\\frac{1}{a^{2}}&amp;space;+&amp;space;1&amp;space;+&amp;space;a^{2}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" />","Bukan diantara A, B .C dan D</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc0OA"},{"id":"NDI-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Lima ekor kambing memakan rumput seluas 5 kali ukuran lapangan bola dalam 5 hari.</p><p>Berapa hari yang diperlukan oleh 3 ekor kambing unutk menghabiskan rumput seluas 3 kali lapangan bola ?</p>","choices":["2","3","4","5","6</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc1Mg"},{"id":"NDI-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika untuk setiap x, y bilangan real berlaku x$y = x + y maka (x + y)$(x - y) sama dengan</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img title=\"x^{2} - y^{2} +2x\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;y^{2}&amp;space;+2x\" />","<img title=\"x^{2} - y^{2} - 2x\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;y^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;2x\" />","<img title=\"x^{2} - y^{2} + 2x\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;y^{2}&amp;space;+&amp;space;2x\" />","<img title=\"x^{2} - y^{2} - 2y\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;y^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;2y\" />","<img title=\"x^{2} - y^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x^{2}&amp;space;-&amp;space;y^{2}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc1Nw"},{"id":"NDI-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berapa banyak pasang bilang bulat positif a,b) yang memenuhi&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{1}{a} + \\frac{1}{b} = \\frac{1}{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{1}{a}&amp;space;+&amp;space;\\frac{1}{b}&amp;space;=&amp;space;\\frac{1}{6}\" />&nbsp;?</p>","choices":["1&nbsp;","2","3","4","5"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc2MQ"},{"id":"NDI-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk nilai a yang manakah garis lurus y = 6x memotong parabola&nbsp;<img title=\"y = x^{2} + a\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?y&amp;space;=&amp;space;x^{2}&amp;space;+&amp;space;a\" />&nbsp;tepat di satu titik?</p>","choices":["7","8","9","10","11"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc2NQ"},{"id":"NDI-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Digit 1, 9 ,9 , 8 dalam 1998 mempunyai jumlah total 1 + 9 + 9 + 8 = 27. Bilangan</p><p>berikutnya yang mempunyai jumlah digit 27 terjadi di antara tahun</p>","choices":["2500 dan 2700","2701 dan 2900","3101 dan 9900","3101 dan 9900","9901 dan 9999</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc2OQ"},{"id":"NDI-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada suatu segitiga ABC, sudut C tiga kali besar sudut A dan sudut B dua kali besar sudut A, Berapakah perbcbandingan rasian antara panjang AB dan BC ?</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc3MQ"},{"id":"NDI-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Bando dan Bandi ingin mengecat pagar, Bando dapat menyelesaikan pengecatan pagar oleh dirinya sendiri dalam waktu 3 jam,sedangkan Bandi dapat menyelesaikannya dalam 4 jam. Pada pukul 12:00 siang mereka mulai mengecat pagar bersama-sama. Akan tetapi pada suatu ketika mereka bertengkar. Mereka bertengkar selama 10 menit dan dalam masa itu tidak satupun yang melakukan pengecatan. Setelah pertengkaran tersebut Bandi pergi dan Bando meyelesaikan pengecatan pagar sendirian. Jika Bando menyelesaikan pengecatan padapukul14:25,pada pukul berapakah pertengkaran dimulai?</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc3NQ"},{"id":"NDI-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-width: 120%; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Berapakah jumlah digit-digit bilangan&nbsp;<img title=\"2^{2000} . 5 ^{2003}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2^{2000}&amp;space;.&amp;space;5&amp;space;^{2003}\" />?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc3OA"},{"id":"NDI-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berapa banyak bilangan positif yang kurang dari 10000 yang berbentuk&nbsp;<img title=\"X^{8} + Y^{8}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?X^{8}&amp;space;+&amp;space;Y^{8}\" />&nbsp;untuk suatu bilangan bulat x &gt; 0 dan y &gt;0 ?</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc4Mw"},{"id":"NDI-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Tentuan bilangan n terkecil sehingga setiap subhimpunan dari {1 , 2, 3, .., 20} yang beranggotakan unsur pasti mengandung dua anggotanya yang selisihnya 8</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc4OQ"},{"id":"NDI-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Garis AB dan CD sejajar dan berjarak 4 satuan. Misalkan AD memotong BC di titik P diantara kedua garis. Jika AB = 4 dan CD = 12, berapa jauh P dari garis CD&nbsp; ?</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTc5MQ"},{"id":"NDI-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan dan bilangan real yang berbeda sehingga</p><p><img title=\"\\frac{a}{b}+\\frac{a + 10 b}{b +10a}= 2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{a}{b}+\\frac{a&amp;space;+&amp;space;10&amp;space;b}{b&amp;space;+10a}=&amp;space;2\" /></p><p>Tentukan nilai&nbsp;<img title=\"\\frac{a}{b}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\frac{a}{b}\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTgxNg"},{"id":"NDI-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan bulat positif p&nbsp;<img title=\"\\geq\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\geq\" />&nbsp;2 disebut bilangan prima jika ia hanya mempunyai faktor 1 dan p. Tentukan nilai penjemulahan semua bilangan prima di antara 1dan 100 yang sekaligus bersifat : satu lebihnya dari suatu bilangan kelipatan 5 dan satu kurangnya dari suatu bilangan kelipatan 6.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTgyMQ"},{"id":"NDI-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan&nbsp;<img title=\"a = \\frac{1^{2}}{1}+\\frac{2^{2}}{3}+...\\frac{1000^{2}}{2001}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a&amp;space;=&amp;space;\\frac{1^{2}}{1}+\\frac{2^{2}}{3}+...\\frac{1000^{2}}{2001}\" /></p><p>dan</p><p><img title=\"b = \\frac{1^{2}}{3}+\\frac{2^{2}}{5}+...\\frac{1000^{2}}{2003}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?b&amp;space;=&amp;space;\\frac{1^{2}}{3}+\\frac{2^{2}}{5}+...\\frac{1000^{2}}{2003}\" /></p><p>tentukan bilangat bulat yang nilainya paling dekat ke a -b</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTgyMg"},{"id":"NDI-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu persergi panjang berukuran 9 kali&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2\\sqrt{2}\" />&nbsp;mempunyai titik pusat yang sama dengan suatu lingkaran berjari-jari 2, berapakah luas daerah antara persegi panjang lingkaran tersebut?</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTgyMw"}]
